sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Miura et al. (2009) & Jaslow (1990) cranial suture fractal interdigitation and Kuramoto-Sivashinsky osteogenic instability faithfully reproduces Homo sapiens and Mus musculus sagittal and lambdoid calvarial skull sutures morphology" ;
        dcterms:description "The simulation script(s) 2020-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Homo sapiens and Mus musculus sagittal and lambdoid calvarial skull sutures specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-allometric-cranial-sutures-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2020-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2020-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures.py; output: docs/media/allometric_cranial_sutures_comparison.png; organism: Homo sapiens and Mus musculus sagittal and lambdoid calvarial skull sutures; checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 53dc68ef4189bb186f820ba54b5a160dfe42da44326e82b66ab860cc7d2ad00e; artifact_sha256: a9db7edbea67db2b4950a5be983f2eb6d96310a6e86b3135d5babf4b038114b2; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/allometric_cranial_sutures/allometric_cranial_sutures_reference.json=dbb634957fb6941d..., datasets/allometric_cranial_sutures/human_sagittal_suture_specimen.jpg=b3c411a6a4713770..., datasets/allometric_cranial_sutures/paper_citations.bib=bffc86bbbd2dd3d6..., datasets/allometric_cranial_sutures/scout_manifest.json=226c072307597439...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-allometric-cranial-sutures-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Miura et al. (2009) PNAS 106:11218-11223 fourth-order Kuramoto-Sivashinsky / KPZ osteogenic front instability dh/dt = -alpha*d^2h/dx^2 - beta*d^4h/dx^4 + (v_0/2)*(dh/dx)^2 + eta(x,t) generating self-affine fractal cranial suture interdigitation (D_f ~ 1.30-1.45) and collapse to a flat line under surgical mechanical unloading | Jaslow (1990) J. Biomech. 23:313-321 monotonic enhancement of cranial suture bending and impact energy absorption with Suture Interdigitation Index SII = L_arc / L_chord | Khonsari et al. (2013) Proc. R. Soc. B 280:20122670 & Zollikofer & Weissmann (2011) J. Anat. 219:100-114 bidirectional normal-front overhang and FGFR2 craniosynostosis fusion; reconstructed_in_script: Pseudo-spectral integrating-factor / ETDRK2 Kuramoto-Sivashinsky + KPZ nonlinear normal-growth solver coupled to 2D bidirectional overhanging front propagation and mesenchymal cleft phase field across 5 developmental/pathological regimes and a 15x15 (alpha, beta) morphospace | Automated CV calvarial segmentation, sagittal suture midline cleft extraction, SII (2.6791), and 5-scale dyadic box-counting fractal dimension (D_f = 1.2847, log-log r = 0.9964) on human_sagittal_suture_specimen.jpg; transfer_boundary: 1D/2D overhanging osteogenic suture front geometry (x(s), y(s)), box-counting dimension D_f, Suture Interdigitation Index SII, and Jaslow bending energy ratio compared against superior-view human calvarial sagittal suture morphology; does_not_claim: 3D trabecular diploe micro-CT finite-element fracture mechanics or single-cell scRNA-seq trajectories of Twist1+/Runx2+ suture stem cells]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/0021-9290(90)90059-C>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0813269106>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.2012.2670>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1469-7580.2011.01386.x> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.922"^^xsd:double .

    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2020-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
